   "locked": false,
   "text": "At-least-once (the relay) + idempotent (the consumer) is the whole guarantee: Kleppmann's \"effectively-once.\" Neither half alone is the pattern.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "At-least-once (the relay) + idempotent (the consumer) is the whole guarantee: Kleppmann's \"effectively-once.\" Neither half alone is the pattern.",
